%% title: Consent Grant Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant TPP
    participant ConsentService
    participant SCAService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as Consent Outbox
    participant Kafka

    TPP->>ConsentService: POST /api/v1/consents (party_id, grantee_id, scopes, accounts, valid_to)
    ConsentService->>DB: INSERT consents (status=PENDING_SCA)
    ConsentService->>DB: INSERT consent_scopes, consent_accounts
    ConsentService->>SCAService: initiate SCA challenge (purpose=CONSENT_GRANT)
    ConsentService-->>TPP: 201 Created (consent_id, redirect_uri for SCA)

    TPP->>SCAService: complete SCA challenge
    SCAService-->>ConsentService: SCA_CHALLENGE_COMPLETED event (via Kafka)

    ConsentService->>DB: UPDATE consents SET status=ACTIVE, sca_reference
    ConsentService->>Outbox: INSERT consent_outbox (CONSENT_GRANTED)
    Outbox->>Kafka: publish CONSENT_GRANTED

    TPP->>ConsentService: DELETE /api/v1/consents/{id}
    ConsentService->>DB: UPDATE consents SET status=REVOKED, revoked_at, revoked_reason
    ConsentService->>Outbox: INSERT consent_outbox (CONSENT_REVOKED)
    Outbox->>Kafka: publish CONSENT_REVOKED
